:: explanation.happy [explanation] {"position":"1475,275","size":"100,100"}
<img src="images/good.png" class="explanation-icon"> People in Phonopolis are happy when everyone who wants to own a phone, actually owns a phone, phones work well, are easy to use, and user data is protected. Phones should not be too expensive or break easily.

<div class="passage-navigation">

[[Continue->Start3]]

</div>

